\tr{\td{9: a universe parameter is named without its name}\td{2: \code{oh-lvl-param-name-bad}, \code{oh-lvl-closure-param-bad}}}
\tr{\td{10: successors are named without their count}\td{\code{oh-lit-succ-axiom-bad}}}
