\tr{\td{4: the rank rule is dropped; 5, 6, 8: an answer is written under eager reduction, read under it, committed by a declaration that entered it}\td{no row: a file is checked in file order by one worker, and the eager rows are of the tolerated kind either way. These rules are covered by the unit tests only}}
}
}

