\p{The executable of the final build, \code{\verb~|--threads 1 --stats~}: one worker checks the file in order after a batch load, so every counter is deterministic. Base: the pristine build; "with the table": the candidate with \code{\verb~|-X machine.switches=default,closedpairs~}.}

