\tr{\td{con-leche}\td{71.21 M}\td{64.00 M}\td{-10.1 \%}\td{2.96 M}\td{2.35 M}\td{-20.4 \%}\td{-8.4 \%}\td{95,504}\td{133,813}\td{455,760}\td{21.5 MiB}\td{4 / 4}\td{0, 0}}
\tr{\td{navier-stokes-euler}\td{145.39 M}\td{131.11 M}\td{-9.8 \%}\td{6.30 M}\td{4.65 M}\td{-26.2 \%}\td{-8.7 \%}\td{448,249}\td{341,582}\td{1,696,723}\td{70.5 MiB}\td{32 / 32}\td{0, 0}}
\tr{\td{cslib}\td{216.88 M}\td{204.36 M}\td{-5.8 \%}\td{9.35 M}\td{8.04 M}\td{-14.1 \%}\td{-4.5 \%}\td{346,068}\td{219,481}\td{1,103,169}\td{48.5 MiB}\td{14 / 14}\td{0, 0}}
\tr{\td{Mathlib}\td{576.35 M}\td{550.48 M}\td{-4.5 \%}\td{24.71 M}\td{21.95 M}\td{-11.2 \%}\td{-4.1 \%}\td{858,013}\td{488,579}\td{2,595,112}\td{112.5 MiB}\td{120 / 120}\td{0, 0}}
}

\ul{
\li{\strong{Ticks} down by 4.5 to 15.1 \%, unfoldings by 11 to 28 \% (reachability: 169 answers, unchanged). That is 0.9 to 6.5 points less than with one worker: the eight tables together hold 1.6 to 2 times the pairs of the one table and answer 83 to 92 \% as many comparisons, because every worker computes a pair itself before it can answer it (section 2.5).}
\li{\strong{Verdicts.} ACCEPT on all eight with the switch off and on; the machine declines the same number of units (0, 2, 2, 0, 4, 32, 14 and 120 declines, warm and cold counted), no rejection of the machine, no warm anomaly, no unit that the machine could not decide. Section 6 has the 64 runs.}
\li{\strong{Size.} 1.9 MiB (reachability) to 112.5 MiB (Mathlib) for the eight tables together; no table reached a bound.}
}
}

